  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accounting &amp; Auditing Reform IDF Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF Grant Accounting and Auditing Reform in Azerbaijan Republic for the Implementation of Country Financial Accountability Assessment (CFAA). Reason for Delay: 10/06/2004 em from TM As an update to the Effectiveness of the above IDF Grant, we are experiencing delays in the signing of the above  Grant by the Borrower, but we have been assured that the Grant will be signed in the next two weeks.  The delay is in the Prime Minister&apos;s office which has to assign the individual to sign the Grant Agreement outside of the Ministry of Finance.  As the Ministry of Finance is implementing the Grant, it was decided by the Government authorities that another Ministry i.e. Ministry of Interior would sign the Grant.  Another issue that caused delay is the discussion on the international consultants fees which had been deemed high by some government officials, and which has now been resolved. We expect the Grant to be signed in two weeks time.    The procurement process for contracting consultant&apos;s services (other than signing contracts) has been completed.</narrative>
  </description>
